Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.82,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirotan
Dialogue: 9,0:00:06.88,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Burası tam saklambaç oynamalık yer.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,O zaman, ben ebe olurum.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.50,0:00:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Saklanacağım.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.44,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nereye saklansam?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.86,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bir, iki, üç... hazır mısınız?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hazırız!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Burada yok...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Burada da yok...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.40,0:00:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.85,0:00:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Buldum!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:41.36,0:00:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Buldun beni.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:46.96,0:00:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kılık değiştirmede çok iyiyim.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:50.79,0:00:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Beni asla bulamazsın.
